From e415e814c3b2f4a8434771c27b37dfc151a32ef1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Justin <justurn@live.com>
Date: Sun, 20 Sep 2026 00:41:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 01/14] fix: F-195 - shim call-guarding SEH for the llvm-mingw
 i686 build

