wrap calls (CrashHandler's memcpy, SafeGetRenderCtx, BuildBoneRemapGuarded,
ApplyRawTriFilter, OnM2SkinFinalize) use the core's WXL_SEH_TRY/WXL_SEH_EXCEPT
shim from core/SehCompat.hpp. The three guards around pure memory reads are
