with two settings ended up with two [EquipExtension] sections. GetPrivateProfileInt
searches only the FIRST, so 'Enabled' always read as absent: every boot appended
another default block and the value the user had edited was ignored - setting
Enabled=0 did nothing and the module stayed on.

